### 1. Успешный capture
POST http://localhost:8080/payments/capture
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "pay_ok_001",
  "amountMinor": 10000,
  "currency": "RUB",
  "cardNumber": "4111111111111111",
  "cvv": "123",
  "token": "tok_live_xyz",
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### 2. Ошибка валидации (amountMinor=0)
POST http://localhost:8080/payments/capture
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "pay_fail_001",
  "amountMinor": 0,
  "currency": "RUB",
  "cardNumber": "4111111111111111",
  "cvv": "123",
  "token": "tok_live_xyz",
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### 3. Проверка health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 4. Проверка readiness
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health/readiness

### 5. Метрика ошибок
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/metrics/payment.capture.errors

### 6. Prometheus
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus